  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihood recovery of the most vulnerable among the refugees from Nagorno Karabakh and their host communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at rehabilitating the livelihood systems of the groups in the most vulnerable situations among the refugees from NK and the host communities in a way that meets core humanitarian standards and minimum economic recovery standards. This will contribute to increasing refugees&#x2019; protection levels, expanding their access to socioeconomic rights and opportunities, decreasing their dependence on humanitarian aid, re-establishing a sense of normalcy in their lives and diminishing the pressure on public budgets and host communities&#x2019; generous hospitality.</narrative>
  </description>
